                <head>Agreements between the United States and Switzerland</head>
                <p>[For text of Agreement, effected by exchanges of notes signed at Bern May 13,
                    1949, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series
                    (TIAS) No. 1929, or 63 Stat. (pt. 3) 243T.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND SWITZERLAND
                    RESPECTING SETTLEMENT OF CERTAIN WAR CLAIMS</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement, effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington
                    October 21, 1949, see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts
                    Series (TIAS) No. 2112, or 64 Stat. (pt. 3) B 1097.]</p>
